{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19839","headline":"罪松 · 孟郊","name":"罪松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虽爲青松姿，霜风何所宜。\n二月天下树，绿於青松枝。\n勿谓贤者喻，勿谓愚者规。\n伊吕代封爵，夷齐终身饥。\n彼曲既在斯，我正实在兹。\n泾流合渭流，清浊各自持。\n天令设四时，荣衰有常期。\n荣合随时荣，衰合随时衰。\n天令既不从，甚不敬天时。\n松乃不臣木，青青独何爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19839.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19839","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}